{
  "date": "2026-10-23",
  "requirements": {
    "CAS01": "Replace the Garage background with a stylish abstract background for the selected challenge car and all five car cards.",
    "R01": "Keep the exact fixed camera/environment across selections, original garage car-switch animation, real models/cosmetics, whole-row carousel edge behavior and source/verification/exact-ticket guards.",
    "G01": "Actual native views of every selected car, abstract hero/cards, transition phases and responsive/delayed-input layouts in both desktop renderers.",
    "Q01": "Focused and integrated challenge checks, original Garage transition regression, import, complete parser, original asset provenance and scoped checkpoint."
  },
  "art_direction": "Charcoal and petrol-blue continuous cove with broad restrained curved tonal bands, a quiet muted brass trace, soft warm/cool studio lighting and a slim matte/satin circular plinth. The backdrop stays subordinate to the actual cars and controls.",
  "implementation": {
    "scene": "Challenge-only abstract_mode selects the new original procedural studio and pedestal. No Garage architecture or Garage reflection viewports are prepared for challenge views.",
    "camera": "The existing fixed showroom pose/distance is retained across all five cars; reset uses the same abstract-camera elevation.",
    "animation": "The original GarageCarReveal hide/reveal tween swaps only the car/plinth while retaining the abstract backdrop, camera and viewport. Contact shadows use the same existing reveal treatment.",
    "runtime": "No new textures, samplers, time-driven background animation or external service. Read-only model views retain on-demand drawing and bounded animation work.",
    "provenance": "Original project-authored shader, palette, lights and primitive plinth geometry. Reuses the original seamless cove, contact shader, car models and reveal code. Recorded in licenses/ASSETS.md."
  },
